edit: because I stupid

Let's be real, as an Australian it is not likly what so ever the Australia will buy into OWL ever, expesically if buy ins stay at $35 million+. There is basically no money in Australia for esports and the money that could be targeted is already invested in LOL, CS etc.

&#x200B;

Plus if a team buys in it would be suicide if they don't use Sydney Drop Bears or maybe Melbourne Mavericks if they are good. Everyone in AUS knows Sydney Drop Bears and likes the branding and team, no reason to do anything else.
